<title>SWITZERLAND: Markets may ride Italy,Spain EMU launch miss - Soros.</title>
<headline>Markets may ride Italy,Spain EMU launch miss - Soros.</headline>
<dateline>DAVOS, Switzerland 1996-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial markets may show relatively little reaction if Italy and Spain were eventually excluded from the first wave of monetary union provided they were guaranteed a place in the second, financial investor George Soros said.</p>
</text>
